g="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/expedia.svg"/><img alt="Shopee e-commerce data extraction with Scrape.do" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/shopee.svg"/><img alt="Revenue Grid intelligence gathering using Scrape.do" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/revenue-grid.svg"/><img alt="Revolut uses Scrape.do for reliable web scraping" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/revolut.svg"/><img alt="Zeo powered by Scrape.do web scraping API" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/zeo.svg"/><img alt="Otelz leverages Scrape.do for data extraction" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/otelz.svg"/><img alt="TripAdvisor data collection powered by Scrape.do" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/tripadvisor.svg"/><img alt="Expedia scraping solution via Scrape.do" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/expedia.svg"/><img alt="Shopee e-commerce data extraction with Scrape.do" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/shopee.svg"/><img alt="Revenue Grid intelligence gathering using Scrape.do" loading="lazy" width="100" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-auto h-7 shrink-0" style="color:transparent" src="/images/revenue-grid.svg"/></div></section><section class="pt-14 pb-8 md:py-26"><div class="wrapper"><div class="w-fit mx-auto text-center"><h2 class="section__heading">From bypassing WAFs<span class="block">to seamlessly scaling your operations</span></h2><p class="text-font-16 mt-6 max-w-[18.75rem] mx-auto lg:max-w-full">All the tools you need to scrape the web with efficiency.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-10 md:mt-14"><div class="card__outline p-8 px-3.5 md:p-7.5 lg:py-10 lg:pr-7.5 lg:pl-16 lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-10 lg:gap-17.5"><div class="w-full lg:max-w-[19.125rem] pl-4.5 md:pl-0"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded border border-custom-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-7"><div class="relative"><span class="text-font-20">API</span><span class="text-font-13 absolute -right-1.5 top-4">1</span></div></div><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal">Web Scraping API</h3><p class="mt-4 lg:max-w-[18.125rem]">Effortlessly retrieve data with a single request. We handle proxies, headers, CAPTCHAs, and more to ensure a 99.98% success rate.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Arrow polygon icon pointing to web scraping API feature" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3" style="color:transparent" src="/images/arrow-polygon.svg"/><p>Automated Proxy Rotation</p></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Arrow polygon icon pointing to web scraping API feature" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3" style="color:transparent" src="/images/arrow-polygon.svg"/><p>WAF &amp; CAPTCHA Bypass</p></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Arrow polygon icon pointing to web scraping API feature" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3" style="color:transparent" src="/images/arrow-polygon.svg"/><p>JS Rendering and Interactions</p></li></ul><a class="custom__btn custom__btn--sm custom__shadow--black-btn gap-1.5 mt-5 group" href="/products/web-scraping-api/">Discover - API<span class="w-5 h-5 relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><img class="w-5 h-5 will-change-transform -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-2.5 transition-all duration-600" src="/images/arrow-right-small.svg" alt="arrow right small"/><img class="w-5 h-5 will-change-transform -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-2.5 transition-all duration-600" src="/images/arrow-right-small.svg" alt="arrow right small"/></span></a></div><div class="flex-1"><img class="max-md:max-w-[34.375rem] md:w-full mx-auto md:mx-0 blck" alt="how does scrape.do work" src="/homepage-web-scraping-api.svg"/></div></div><div class="card__outline p-8 px-3.5 md:p-7.5 lg:py-10 lg:pl-7.5 lg:pr-16 lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse lg:items-center gap-10 lg:gap-17.5 overflow-hidden"><div class="w-full lg:max-w-[19.125rem] pl-4.5 md:pl-0"><div class="w-14 h-14 rounded border border-custom-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-7"><div class="relative"><span class="text-font-20">RDY</span><span class="text-font-13 absolute -right-1.5 top-4">2</span></div></div><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal">Ready Scraper APIs</h3><p class="mt-4 lg:max-w-[18.125rem]">Pre-built endpoints for the web&#x27;s biggest sites. One HTTP call returns parsed JSON. No HTML parsing, no anti-bot infrastructure, no breakage when the target redesigns.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Arrow polygon icon pointing to ready scraper API feature" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3" style="color:transparent" src="/images/arrow-polygon.svg"/><p>Parsed JSON, No HTML Selectors</p></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Arrow polygon icon pointing to ready scraper API feature" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3" style="color:transparent" src="/images/arrow-polygon.svg"/><p>Localization, Pagination, and Filters Built In</p></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Arrow polygon icon pointing to ready scraper API feature" loading="lazy" width="12" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-3" style="color:transparent" src="/images/arrow-polygon.svg"/><p>Pay Only for Successful Requests</p></li></ul><a class="custom__btn custom__btn--sm custom__shadow--black-btn gap-1.5 mt-5 group" href="/products/ready-api/">Browse all Ready APIs<span class="w-5 h-5 relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><img class="w-5 h-5 will-change-transform -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-2.5 transition-all duration-600" src="/images/arrow-right-small.svg" alt="arrow right small"/><img class="w-5 h-5 will-change-transform -translate-x-2.5 group-hover:translate-x-2.5 transition-all duration-600" src="/images/arrow-right-small.svg" alt="arrow right small"/></span></a></div><div class="flex-1 w-full marquee-mask overflow-hidden flex flex-col gap-8 relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-0 right-0 h-px bg-custom-yellow pointer-events-none" style="top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%)"></span><div class="marquee-ltr flex items-center w-max "><ul aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center gap-6 md:gap-8 pr-6 md:pr-8 absolute -top-[9999px] -left-[9999px] pointer-events-none"><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32"></li></ul><ul class="flex items-center gap-6 md:gap-8 pr-6 md:pr-8 shrink-0"><li class="shrink-0 w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center relative"><img src="/uploads/google-search-logo.png" alt="Google Search" class="h-20 w-auto object-conta