="wrapper relative md:pt-12 lg:pt-[7rem]"><img alt="Decorative grid pattern background for web scraping challenges section" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="800" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-auto z-10 hidden lg:block" style="color:transparent" src="/images/challenge-grid.svg"/><div class="relative z-20"><div class="w-full max-w-3/4 mx-auto text-center"><h2 class="section__heading">Web scraping is a challenge in 2026</h2></div><div class="swiper challengeSwiper mt-12"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="bg-custom-white rounded-[1.125rem] p-8 md:p-12 min-h-[29.8125rem] custom__shadow--md overflow-hidden relative"><img class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-fit h-auto xl:h-[26.3125rem] z-10" src="/images/challenge-object-1.svg" alt="challenge"/><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-fit h-auto xl:h-[26.3125rem] z-10"></div><div class="relative z-20"><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal max-w-[11.5625rem]">Blocked at Every Turn</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-[18.625rem]">Anti-bot systems and constant WAF updates make accessing data feel impossible.</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="bg-custom-white rounded-[1.125rem] p-8 md:p-12 min-h-[29.8125rem] custom__shadow--md overflow-hidden relative"><img class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-full h-auto z-10" src="/images/challenge-object-2.svg" alt="challenge"/><div class="relative z-20"><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal max-w-[11.5625rem]">Scaling is a Nightmare</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-[18.625rem]">Managing proxies, headers, and retries is overwhelming for a handful of requests, let alone millions.</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="bg-custom-white rounded-[1.125rem] p-8 md:p-12 min-h-[29.8125rem] custom__shadow--md overflow-hidden relative"><img class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-full h-auto z-10" src="/images/challenge-object-3.svg" alt="challenge"/><div class="relative z-20"><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal max-w-[11.5625rem]">Other Tools Just Don&#x27;t Work</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-[18.625rem]">You end up needing multiple overpriced and inconsistent tools to cover all your target domains.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-pagination"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-20 pt-3 md:pt-5"><div class="wrapper"><div class="w-full max-w-[18.75rem] md:max-w-[48.75rem] mx-auto text-center"><h2 class="section__heading">We&#x27;ll do the heavy lifting for you</h2></div><div class="space-y-6 md:space-y-10 mt-10 md:mt-16"><div class="card__default px-3.5 py-8 md:p-10 xl:py-24 xl:px-[5.375rem] flex flex-col xl:flex-row xl:items-center gap-10 xl:gap-[5.375rem] xl:min-h-[29.5625rem]"><div class="w-full xl:max-w-[23.625rem] pl-4.5 md:pl-0"><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal max-w-[16.875rem]">Scrape Smarter, Faster,<span class="block">and Without Fail</span></h3><div class="mt-5 space-y-2"><p>With a 99.98% success rate, Scrape.do powers through the toughest anti-bot defenses to deliver the data you need<!-- --> <span class="font-medium">fast and hassle-free.</span></p><p>Our scraping API excels where our competitors fail to make sure no data is out of your reach.</p></div></div><div class="flex-1 max-w-[37.5rem] mx-auto xl:max-w-full xl:mx-0"><div class="hidden md:block"></div><img alt="Web scraping success metrics showing 99.98% success rate and performance improvements" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="block md:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/images/scrape-smarter-mobile.svg"/></div></div><div class="card__default px-3.5 pt-8 md:p-10 md:pb-0 xl:pl-10 xl:pr-15.5 flex flex-col xl:flex-row-reverse xl:items-center gap-10 xl:gap-[5.375rem] xl:min-h-[29.5625rem]"><div class="w-full xl:max-w-[23.625rem] pl-4.5 md:pl-0"><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal max-w-[16.875rem]">Seamless Scaling<span class="block">at Unmatched Prices</span></h3><div class="mt-5 space-y-2"><p><span class="font-medium">Grow your scraping operations effortlessly</span> <!-- -->with Scrape.do&#x27;s scalable infrastructure.</p><p>Enjoy the flexibility of a pay-for-success pricing model, enabling you to scale up or down without breaking the bank - making it the most cost-effective solution on the market.</p></div></div><div class="flex-1 xl:self-end max-w-[37.5rem] mx-auto xl:max-w-full xl:mx-0"><img alt="Pricing comparison chart showing Scrape.do&#x27;s cost-effective pay-for-success model" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="hidden md:block" style="color:transparent" src="/images/unmatched-prices.svg"/><img alt="Mobile view of Scrape.do&#x27;s scalable pricing and cost savings" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="block md:hidden" style="color:transparent" src="/images/unmatched-prices-mobile.svg"/></div></div><div class="card__default px-3.5 pt-8 pb-2.5 md:p-10 md:pb-3 xl:py-3.5 xl:px-[5.375rem] flex flex-col xl:flex-row xl:items-center gap-10 xl:gap-[5.375rem] xl:min-h-[29.5625rem]"><div class="w-full xl:max-w-[23.625rem] pl-4.5 md:pl-0"><h3 class="text-font-24 font-normal max-w-[16.875rem]">Expert Support,<span class="block">Whenever You Need It</span></h3><div class="mt-5 space-y-2"><p>When you need help,<!-- --> <span class="font-medium">you won&#x27;t get a ticket number</span> <!-- -->- you&#x27;ll get an expert.</p><p>Our dedicated developer support team is always available to troubleshoot challenges, offer solutions, and ensure your scraping never stops.</p></div></div><div class="flex-1 max-w-[37.5rem] mx-auto xl:max-w-full xl:mx-0"><svg viewBox="0 0 553 443" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><title>expert support</title><path d="M472.346 201.229L283.506 104.245V23.3018C283.506 6.89168 266.358 -3.898 251.548 3.24042L44 103.958V215.014C44 223.342 48.6359 230.973 56.0615 234.829L248.922 334.357V419.156C248.922 435.853 266.522 446.561 281.332 438.971L4