edAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Yes! View your usage data directly on your dashboard page, or access detailed insights with our \u003ca href=\"/documentation/api-response/usage-stats/\">Statistics API\u003c/a>.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a super proxy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>You can force Scrape.do to use mobile and residential IP pool with using super proxy. It’s best proxy type for web scraping and data harvesting.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I need more Successful API Credits limit than 3.5 millions","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>We&#39;ve got you covered! Contact us at \u003ca href=\"mailto:sales@scrape.do\">sales@scrape.do\u003c/a> for a customer service package tailored to your exact needs.\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you create custom scraping scripts for me?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Absolutely! We offer a fully customizable scraping API to tailor to your needs. Reach out at \u003ca href=\"mailto:sales@scrape.do\">sales@scrape.do\u003c/a> and let’s talk about what we can do together!\u003c/p>\n"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I have a technical question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\u003cp>Our extensive documentation covers every technical detail you might need - built to get you up and running without a hitch. But if you need more help, expert developers are available 24/7 at \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@scrape.do\">support@scrape.do\u003c/a>\u003c/p>\n"}}]}</script><div class="wrapper"><div class="w-full max-w-3/4 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start gap-10 lg:gap-[7.375rem]"><div class="w-full max-w-2/5"><p class="text-font-16 text-custom-gray-500">F.A.Q</p><h2 class="text-font-40 tracking-tight mt-1 md:mt-3">Frequently Asked Questions.</h2><p class="text-font-16 font-normal max-w-[18.75rem] mt-2 md:mt-4">Get answers to commonly asked questions.</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="custom__accordion custom__accordion--faq"><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Can I cancel anytime?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Yes, you can! Simply head to your dashboard to cancel, and you won’t be charged again - unless, of course, you decide to come back!</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Do you have a free trial?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Yes! Get 1,000 successful API credits with 5 concurrent requests, completely free. Sign up and explore what’s possible with our data harvesting tools, no strings attached.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Can I get a refund if I&#x27;m not satisfied?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Though it’s rare, we do offer refunds within the first three days of purchase. Just make sure to review our refunds policy for details.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Do I need a credit card to start the free trial?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Not at all! Our free trial is truly free - no credit card required.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Do I get charged for the failed requests?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Absolutely not! Only successful requests use up API credits—failed requests won’t be deducted from your balance.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Can I see my usage data?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Yes! View your usage data directly on your dashboard page, or access detailed insights with our <a href="/documentation/api-response/usage-stats/">Statistics API</a>.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">What is a super proxy?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>You can force Scrape.do to use mobile and residential IP pool with using super proxy. It’s best proxy type for web scraping and data harvesting.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">I need more Successful API Credits limit than 3.5 millions</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>We&#39;ve got you covered! Contact us at <a href="mailto:sales@scrape.do">sales@scrape.do</a> for a customer service package tailored to your exact needs.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">Can you create custom scraping scripts for me?</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Absolutely! We offer a fully customizable scraping API to tailor to your needs. Reach out at <a href="mailto:sales@scrape.do">sales@scrape.do</a> and let’s talk about what we can do together!</p>
</div></div></div><div class="accordion__item"><button class="accordion__button" type="button"><h3 class="text-font-16 font-normal">I have a technical question</h3><div class="accordion__icon"><img class="accordion__icon-plus" src="/images/faq-plus.svg" alt="plus"/><img class="accordion__icon-minus" src="/images/faq-minus.svg" alt="minus"/></div></button><div class="accordion__content"><div class="space-y-4 pt-3 pb-2 faq-content"><p>Our extensive documentation covers every technical detail you might need - built to get you up and running without a hitch. But if you need more help, expert developers are available 24/7 at <a href="mailto:support@scrape.do">support@scrape.do</a></p>
